      "stepNumber": 2,
      "title": "Evaluate Derivative",
      "mathExpression": "u' = 2x, \\quad u^2 = (x^2)^2 = x^4 \\implies \\frac{dy}{dx} = \\frac{2x}{1 + x^4}",
      "explanation": "Substitute u and u'.",
      "why": "Final derivative expression."
